| labels (exists)        | scope        | labels                        | none                   | II.G   |
| prop                   | scope        | key values only               | none                   | II.H   |
| logbook                | pair         | body of clock tags and notes  | fold                   | III.A  |
| clock                  | scope        | start; end; dur               | none                   | III.A  |
| fn                     | scope, pair  | label                         | jump                   | III.C  |
| comment (name exists)  | line, block  | text                          | none                   | III.F  |
| clocktable             | block, pair  | span; scope; by               | run, writes result     | III.G  |
| math                   | line         | latex text                    | none, injection        | III.H  |

