  V. Open questions

-  Is the default sigil convention (`#` for metadata, `@` for reference-like
   inline tags) acceptable, or should planning tags use their own?
-  Should the agenda require a vault? The proposal says yes. A fallback for
   files outside any vault would be an in-memory index of `fey_agenda_files`.
-  Is one `todo` tag per heading title enough, or should the keyword also be
   allowed as a positional prefix of the title, parsed by Lua?
-  Is a `metadata` grammar field worth the paragraph conflict, once the Lua
   helper exists?
-  Which default keys for new mappings that collide (babel tangle versus
   database tab, both `<prefix>bt`)?
